1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:02,890
(Leonard:)Anyway, as I was saying,

2
00:00:03,048 --> 00:00:05,758
(Leonard:)Sheldon probably just
needs a little alone time.

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,930
'Cause that's important.

4
00:00:12,324 --> 00:00:14,464
(Leonard:)Not just for him, but for...

5
00:00:15,461 --> 00:00:17,341
(Leonard:)...most anybody, really.

6
00:00:17,496 --> 00:00:19,636
(Amy:)Don't I know it.

7
00:00:19,798 --> 00:00:21,438
(Amy:)-What is that, polenta?
-Amy, get out.

8
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:22,737
(Penny:)Right.

9
00:00:28,407 --> 00:00:29,407
(Howard:)No.

10
00:00:33,445 --> 00:00:34,445
(Stuart:)Hey, Sheldon.

11
00:00:34,613 --> 00:00:36,183
(Leonard:)What happened?

12
00:00:36,348 --> 00:00:38,188
(Stuart:)I was cooking
in the back room last night

13
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:42,300
(Stuart:)-and the hot plate caught on fire.
-And you couldn't put it out?

14
00:00:42,454 --> 00:00:45,094
(Stuart:)I was across the street
at the do-it-yourself car wash,

15
00:00:45,257 --> 00:00:46,597
(Stuart:)taking a shower.

16
00:00:49,862 --> 00:00:51,362
(Sheldon:)So when will you reopen?

17
00:00:51,664 --> 00:00:57,024
(Stuart:)Um, I don't know. I'm waiting to hear
back from the insurance company.

